              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "1010lisalynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Simply fresh lusciousness! My husband states \" I'll have to give it 5 stars because you won't let me give it 6! Perfect crunchy ingredients to complement the greens! I usually prefer cold salad but this room temp dressing is so appealing (olive oil, red wine vinegar and 1/2 package of wishbone dry salad dressing mix)",
            "datePublished": "2023-02-03T04:37:33.581Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
